medical shows have long been a staple of  prime time television  as the life and death stakes combined  with the toll the job takes on doctors  and nurses can make for gripping dramas  shows such as er house and grey's  anatomy  have all highlighted the heartache and  humanity at the core  of every healthcare emergency tragically  though for the hit series new amsterdam  the medical drama has become  all too real resulting in the sudden and  shocking departure  of one of its biggest stars airing on  nvc  new amsterdam follows the travails of a  new medical director  and the head of several hospital  departments at america's oldest public  hospital  as they try to move past stifling  bureaucracy to keep the focus on  patients  the hit show is based on the book twelve  patients life and death at bellevue  hospital  by eric mannheimer the all-star ensemble  cast of the show  includes performers such as ryan eggold  frema ageman  and tyler levine in the main cast but  one of the most important stars was  luminary indian performer  anupam kerr kerr who is best known to  american audiences for his role in  silver linings playbook  is one of india's most famous actors  having appeared  in more than 500 films on new amsterdam  kerr played dr vijay kapoor who was the  focal point of a major storyline in  season 3  after the character contracted coven 19  and disappeared into isolation in the  season's second episode  much of the early part of the season  then revolved around his illness  in the attempts by the hospital staff to  ensure he survives and regains his  health  however in the season's seventh episode  which aired april 13th  the staff was shocked to learn that dr  kapoor would not be returning to new  amsterdam hospital  at all as he instead resigned vijay's  doctor told him he's never going to work  again  um about a month ago as surprised as the  characters on the show  were fans were even more surprised to  learn that kerr was actually leaving the  show for good  and had been written out at his own  request why  sadly the answer is even more tragic  than any plot line on new amsterdam  anupam kerr's wife kiran kur is a  well-known performer and politician  in her own right on april 1st 2021  anu pomker revealed on twitter that his  wife had been diagnosed with multiple  myeloma  which is also known as collars disease  multiple myeloma  is a rare type of blood cancer that  affects plasma cells  a type of white blood cell found in bone  marrow unfortunately  there is yet no known cure for multiple  myeloma  but with early detection and treatment  it can potentially become dormant for  long periods of time  anupamker's statement which was made in  conjunction with his son  sikander reads in part she is currently  undergoing treatment and we are sure she  will come out of this  stronger than before we are very blessed  that she's being looked after by a  phenomenal set of doctors  she's always been a fighter and takes  things head-on she's all heart and  that's why she has so many people that  love her  so keep sending your love to her in your  prayers and in your heart  two weeks later tv insider reported that  cursed parcher from new amsterdam would  be permanent  and on april 27th kerr tweeted another  statement to fans  reflecting on his time as dr vijay  kapoor on  new amsterdam this past year has been  difficult for so many people around the  world  not least for dr kapoor it was an  incredibly special time for me to be  part of this show  and one i will never forget the new  amsterdam family will always hold a  special place in my heart  i am grateful to the audience for their  love support and good wishes  particularly for my wife kieran at this  time  i hope you all will continue to join me  on my journey  and future projects here's wishing the  whole kerr family the best of luck  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite tv shows are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

